@startuml
title 图 5-3  BP-02 超时释放 · 定时任务（UML Activity Diagram）
skinparam defaultFontName "DengXian"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F4F7FC
  BorderColor #55607A
  FontColor #1F2A40
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7E6
  DiamondBorderColor #55607A
  StartColor #2B3550
  EndColor #2B3550
  BarColor #2B3550
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #55607A
  TitleFontColor #2B3550
  BackgroundColor #FAFBFD
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #55607A
  FontColor #444444
}

|定时任务|
start
:调度器每 60 秒触发;
repeat
  :查询过期待签到预约（≤ 200 条）;
  :条件更新：仅当状态 = 待签到;
  if (更新成功?) then (否)
    :跳过（已签到 / 已处理）;
  else (是)
    :置为已爽约 → 释放座位\n→ 写账本（幂等键：预约号 + 原因）→ 通知;
  endif
repeat while (还有待处理记录?) is (是) -> (否)
:写批次统计与审计;
stop

@enduml
